  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASHOKA I Billet Express Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Express Ticket is an online digital ticketing service dedicated to road transport. It offers travelers the possibility of booking or purchasing bus tickets in 60 seconds via the web (Internet) or Mobile platforms (SMS, USSD, Application). Billet Express pilot phase was launched in September 2016 and the production phase in June 2017, totaling more than 3,500 customers. Within a 5-year horizon, Billet express intends to become the leader in ticketing and innovative services in the field of transport in Mali and West Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
